Subject: [PATCH] input: add staged TB522FU UART keyboard and trackpad

Use serdev and the standard input subsystem for the Lenovo detachable
keyboard. Bounds-check and checksum packets before reporting keys or touch.
Release input state on detach/lid close and follow the stock GPIO power
sequence. TX stays disabled in this first receive-only candidate.

Stock captures confirm9216008N1, active-low plug/lid GPIOs, eight-byte HID
boot reports after command/length, and four touch slots. The codec matches
1008 complete captured packets and passes host sanitizer cases. The driver
object compiles for ARM64; Linux hardware input is not yet validated.

